 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "From a Million-View Fitness YouTuber to a Powerless Nobody in a Webtoon"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "100만 운동 유튜버인 내가 이 웹툰에서는 초능력도 없는 쩌리 - 부제: 원래 그랬음"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In a world overrun by monstrous threats, humanity discovers newfound strength. Amidst flashy heroes who never train, one man stands tall—Malwang, the eccentric guardian of SSAE Gym. Clad in tiger-striped gear and armed with pork trotters, he welcomes beginners with open arms and loud encouragement. Together with his quirky gym crew, Malwang fights for fitness, fun, and the future of humanity. Packed with wild action and offbeat humor, this is a story about building strong bodies—and even stronger spirits."
  },
